      "content": "it’s happening again. i walked into the kitchen and just... stood there. i knew i went in for something, but the thought is just gone. like a piece of my brain just flickered out. i’m so scared that one day i’m just gonna wake up and i won't even know my own name. i dont want to become a ghost in my own body.",
